+# counts, same parameter budget (see src/tgfem/module.py CHANNEL COUNT / Phase 2
+# finding: `identity=True` still materialises proj/channel_gate/spatial_gate,
+# it just never uses them in forward). The only difference is the second YAML
+# arg, `True`, which forces every TGFEM instance into exact pass-through mode.
+#
+# This isolates "does TG-FEM's mechanism do anything" from "does TG-FEM have
+# more parameters than stock" - a naive ablation that just deletes the layer
+# would confound the two. See phase-notes/PHASE-2.md section 4.
